  "tags": [
    "Tokens",
    "Go wide",
    "Aristocrats",
    "Combat damage"
  ],
  "strategy": "Zurgo Stormrender mobilizes a hasty Warrior every attack and pays for every creature token that leaves: a card if it was attacking, a point of life from each opponent if it was not. The deck floods the board with tokens that are meant to leave: Hero of Bladehold, Legion Warboss, Siege-Gang Commander, Beetleback Chief and Lingering Souls make bodies, Infantry Shield, Redoubled Stormsinger, Blade of Selves and Legion Loyalty copy attackers that vanish at end of combat or the end step, and Kaya, Geist Hunter doubles a turn's tokens. Viscera Seer, Skullclamp, Morbid Opportunist and Bastion of Remembrance turn the leftovers into cards and drain, Commander's Insignia, Ogre Battledriver and Goldnight Commander make the swarm hit hard, and Neriv, Crackling Vanguard exiles cards to play on any turn a commander attacked. Swords to Plowshares, Abrade and Bitter Triumph pick off blockers, and Hour of Reckoning, which spares tokens, clears everything else.",
